jñātvā rudro bhavet kṣipraṃ sūkṣmavāyuniṣevaṇāt ॥ 79 ॥
kṛtvā padmāsanaṃ mantrī jaṅghayoḥ hṛdaye karau ।
kūrparasthānaparyantaṃ vibhedya skandhadhāraṇam ॥ 80 ॥
bhitvā padmāsanaṃ mantrī sahasrārdhena ghāṭanam ।
