dakṣapādatalaṃ dakṣapārśve saṃyojya dhārayet ॥ 95 ॥
etajjñānāsanaṃ nātha jñānādvidyāprakāśakam ।
nirantaraṃ yaḥ karoti tasya granthiḥ ślathī bhavet ॥ 96 ॥
